                                                "sense_id": "8c702d40-2ae4-3366-ab1c-5029701a764b",
                                                "text": "Major Jewish holidays such as Rosh Hashanah, Yom Kippur, Simchat Torah, Succoth, Chanukah, Passover and Shavuot have been celebrated with Hebrew prayers and songs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a312c1cb-e8e5-4f17-8347-42bd5ba00be2",
                                                "sense_id": "8c702d40-2ae4-3366-ab1c-5029701a764b",
                                                "text": "On the first day of Shavuot the Ten Commandments were explained to the people homiletically in the vernacular."
                                            }
